  "prefLabel": "Env-A 4102.17 Automotive brake cleaner",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 4102.17 “Automotive brake cleaner” means a cleaning product manufactured prior to January 1, 2017, that is designed to remove oil, grease, brake fluid, brake pad material, or dirt, or any combination thereof, from motor vehicle brake mechanisms.\n\nSource. #10527, eff 2-26-14; ss by #10750, eff 12-19-14; ss by #13969, eff 5-21-24",
